@startuml
title Immutable Lecturer Handover
actor "Outgoing Lecturer" as Out
actor "Incoming Lecturer" as In
actor HOD
participant UI
participant API
participant "Handover Service" as HS
database PostgreSQL
Out -> UI: Prepare handover package
UI -> API: POST /handovers
API -> HS: Create package + immutable version 1
HS -> PostgreSQL: Save checklist, documents, risks, audit
Out -> UI: Submit
HOD -> UI: Request changes or oversee
Out -> UI: Create new version and resubmit
In -> UI: Accept assigned handover
HS -> PostgreSQL: Preserve every version and action
@enduml
